---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | Adipotech';
const description = 'Learn how Adipotech protects your data, secures your transactions, and complies with the Kenya Data Protection Act.';
const lastUpdated = 'November 12, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <main class="page-container">
    <header class="hero">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      <p class="lead">At Adipotech, your privacy is not an afterthought—it is engineered into our platform. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        Adipotech ("we," "our," or "us") operates as a secure media and advertisement platform. We are committed to protecting your personal data in compliance with the <strong>Kenya Data Protection Act, 2019 (KDPA)</strong> and global standards (such as the Google Play Store Developer Policies). This Privacy Policy outlines our practices regarding data collection, processing, and security.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>To provide a seamless and secure experience, we collect limited information depending on how you interact with the platform:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account Data (Premium Users):</strong> When you subscribe, we collect your email address and a secure authentication token. We do <em>not</em> collect or store your password in plaintext.</li>
        <li><strong>Transaction Data:</strong> When you make a donation or subscribe, payment details are handled exclusively by our PCI-DSS compliant payment partner, <strong>Paystack</strong>. We only receive a confirmation token, the amount paid in KES, and your email address. <em>We never see or store your full credit card number.</em></li>
        <li><strong>Interaction Data:</strong> When you like a post, leave a comment, or download a file, we record the action against your user ID to manage entitlements and community features.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> Like all modern websites, our edge network (Cloudflare) automatically logs IP addresses and browser types to protect the platform against DDoS attacks and malicious traffic.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
      <p>We strictly limit the use of your data to the following purposes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>To provide you with access to premium content and manage your subscription status.</li>
        <li>To process payments and donations (via Paystack).</li>
        <li>To send automated notifications (e.g., renewal reminders, reply notifications) if you have subscribed.</li>
        <li>To moderate comments and prevent abuse or spam.</li>
        <li>To comply with legal and tax obligations in Kenya.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>4. Our Security Architecture (Why You Can Trust Us)</h2>
      <p>We built Adipotech to rival enterprise-grade systems. Your data is protected by a multi-layered security model:</p>
      
      <div class="security-grid">
        <div class="security-card">
          <h3>Zero-Trust Administration</h3>
          <p>The admin panel is completely invisible to the public internet. It is protected by identity-aware proxies and hardware-key multi-factor authentication. Public users cannot even reach the admin login screen.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="security-card">
          <h3>Data Isolation</h3>
          <p>We use a decoupled microservices architecture. Your payment data, comments, and subscription status are stored in entirely separate, isolated databases. A vulnerability in the comment system cannot expose your payment history.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="security-card">
          <h3>Edge Encryption</h3>
          <p>All traffic between your device and Adipotech is encrypted using TLS 1.3. Our static-first architecture means most content is served directly from Cloudflare's edge, bypassing our core database entirely.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="security-card">
          <h3>Payment Isolation</h3>
          <p>We never process credit card data ourselves. Transactions are routed directly to Paystack using tokenized, hosted checkout pages, keeping us fully compliant with payment security standards.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>5. Data Retention and Deletion (Overdue Subscriptions)</h2>
      <p>To maintain platform integrity and storage efficiency, we enforce strict data retention policies for premium accounts:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Grace Period:</strong> If a recurring premium payment fails, your account enters a 3-day grace period. Premium features remain accessible.</li>
        <li><strong>Suspension:</strong> If payment is not made after 3 days, your account is suspended. Premium content will be hidden until payment is successful.</li>
        <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> If your premium subscription remains unpaid for one full month (30 days) after suspension, your user profile, uploaded content (if applicable), and comments will be permanently deleted from our active databases. Financial transaction records may be retained in anonymized form to comply with Kenyan tax and audit laws.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>6. Your Rights Under the Kenya DPA</h2>
      <p>Under the Kenya Data Protection Act (2019), you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</li>
        <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Update inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>
        <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request the deletion of your account and personal data (subject to our retention policies above).</li>
        <li><strong>Objection:</strong> Object to the processing of your data for marketing purposes.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:adipotech@gmail.com">adipotech@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>7. Cross-Border Data Transfers</h2>
      <p>
        To provide our services, your data may be processed by our trusted infrastructure partners located outside of Kenya (such as Cloudflare's global edge network). We ensure that all third-party providers adhere to strict data protection agreements and maintain equivalent security standards.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your data is handled, please contact our Data Protection Officer:
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:adipotech@gmail.com">adipotech@gmail.com</a><br />
        <strong>Phone/WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="tel:+254112696334">+254 112 696 334</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.25rem;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
    color: #334155;
  }

  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .last-updated {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #64748b;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero .lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #475569;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .content-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .content-section p, .content-section li {
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .content-section ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .content-section li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .security-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .security-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .security-card {
    background: #f0f9ff;
    border: 1px solid #bae6fd;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .security-card h3 {
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .security-card p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #475569;
  }

  a {
    color: #0f172a;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  a:hover {
    color: #38bdf8;
  }
</style>